@startuml
actor Human
participant CLI
participant Context
participant Approval
participant Worktree
participant Sandbox
participant Codex
participant Validator
database SQLite
Human -> CLI : prepare task scope
CLI -> Context : approved artifact and runtime hashes
Context -> SQLite : awaiting approval
Human -> Approval : exact digest and authenticated identity
Approval -> SQLite : immutable grant
Human -> CLI : run execution
CLI -> Worktree : dedicated branch from approved HEAD
CLI -> Sandbox : verify native scope and network canaries
Sandbox --> CLI : boundary evidence
CLI -> Codex : bounded stdin task and schema
Codex --> CLI : JSON events and structured proposal
CLI -> Validator : exact allowlisted commands in sandbox
Validator --> CLI : observed exit and output
CLI -> SQLite : normalized result, audit, task outcome
CLI --> Human : report and preserved proposal
@enduml
